:: Explore - night [Place]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore/night_explore.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
<<set _nightLight = setup.night.lightSource()>>
You slipped out past the edge of the settlement after dark. The ruins looked different at night. Every doorway was a hole, every shape could have been a person, and somewhere far off something howled and was answered.
<br /><br />
<<if _nightLight === 'lantern'>>
	The lantern hung at your belt, unlit. Light would let you search properly, and it would also tell everyone for a mile exactly where you were.
<<elseif _nightLight === 'torch'>>
	You carried a torch, unlit. Light would let you search properly, and it would also tell everyone for a mile exactly where you were.
<<else>>
	You had no light with you. Whatever you found tonight, you would find by feel and moonlight.
<</if>>
<br /><br />
<<if _nightLight>>
	<<set _searchLabel = (_nightLight === 'lantern' ? 'Light the lantern and search' : 'Light a torch and search')>>
	<<link _searchLabel>>
		<<run setup.night.useLight(_nightLight)>>
		<<run setup.night.startTrip('foot', 'light', _nightLight)>>
		<<goto 'Explore - night roll'>>
	<</link>><<link 'Keep to the dark'>>
		<<run setup.night.startTrip('foot', 'dark')>>
		<<goto 'Explore - night roll'>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link 'Keep to the dark'>>
		<<run setup.night.startTrip('foot', 'dark')>>
		<<goto 'Explore - night roll'>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>
